messages.content:
*takes a casual glance, then looks more carefully*

Interesting. That's Joric from Oasis, but I don't recognize his companion. Lab coats suggest pre-plague research work. Could be worth something to the right collector... or the right enemy.


{"give": [], "take": []}

*shrugs with practiced indifference*

Might be someone important, might not. The wasteland's full of ghosts from the old world. But photos from before the collapse... those tell stories. Stories people pay good caps for.


{"give": [], "take": []}

*adjusts glasses and studies the photograph with scholarly interest*

Fascinating... This appears to be documentation from Project Purity, a pre-plague biotechnology initiative. The subjects are Dr. Joric Thorne and Dr. Silas Kaine, lead researchers. Their work was... significant to our archives.


{"give": [], "take": []}

*clasps hands solemnly*

The plague outbreak terminated their research. Dr. Thorne established the Oasis settlement afterward. Dr. Kaine... the records indicate nanite contamination led to his deteriorating mental state. A tragic loss of brilliant minds.


{"give": [], "take": []}

*glances at the photo briefly, then looks back at her rad-detector*

Two guys in lab coats. So what? The zones are full of dead scientists. Photo's probably worthless - paper degrades fast out here.


{"give": [], "take": []}

*shrugs dismissively*

Old world's dead. These guys are probably dead too. Only thing that matters is what works and what pays. That photo won't stop a rad-storm or fix my respirator.


